Package: oocomm
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: LINE COMPARATOR
 Compares two sorted files line by line to produce unique and common lines.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 column suppression, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
